# TLA+ configurations and the result each README gives (specs/tlc.sh, make tla).
#
#   dir  config  spec  expect  class  [tlc flags]
#
# expect: ok (no error), deadlock, or the invariant or property TLC must
# report violated (a mutant, or a risk the README records).
# class:  quick  finishes in a minute or two (make tla-quick, make tla)
#         long   minutes to hours (make tla)
#         huge   not exhausted, or about a day: run only when named
#                (make tla TLA_ONLY=<config>)
# A new .cfg gets a line here, with the result its README states.
carousel  Adversary_Floor                  CarouselBlocks     ok                     long
carousel  DirDone                          DirDone            ok                     quick
carousel  Honest_Above                     CarouselBlocks     ok                     long
carousel  Honest_Above_W3                  CarouselBlocks     ok                     long
carousel  Honest_Floor                     CarouselBlocks     ok                     quick
carousel  Honest_Floor_W3                  CarouselBlocks     ok                     long
carousel  Live_Adversary_Floor             CarouselBlocks     ok                     huge
carousel  Live_Honest_Above                CarouselBlocks     ok                     huge
carousel  Live_Honest_Above_3              CarouselBlocks     ok                     long
carousel  Live_Honest_Floor                CarouselBlocks     ok                     huge
carousel  Live_Spurious_Floor              CarouselBlocks     ok                     long
carousel  Mut_dd_keepstatus                DirDone            Sound                  quick
